{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BinaryDecisionDiagram","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:16DecisionDiagrams06BinaryA7DiagramV","modules":[{"name":"DecisionDiagrams"}],"symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"BinaryDecisionDiagram"}],"title":"BinaryDecisionDiagram","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/GrafluentCollections\/blob\/main\/Sources\/DecisionDiagrams\/BinaryDecisionDiagram.swift#L27","fileName":"BinaryDecisionDiagram.swift"}},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/BinaryDecisionDiagram","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"BinaryDecisionDiagram"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Variables are tested in index order, 0 nearest the root. The table never holds two vertices","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that test the same variable with the same children, nor a vertex whose children are equal, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each function has one vertex: two ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/BinaryDecisionDiagram\/Function","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" values are equal exactly when they are the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"function.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["var diagram = BinaryDecisionDiagram(variableCount: 3)","let x0 = diagram.variable(0), x1 = diagr